    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41815" root="ورأ" body-key="w">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَرَأَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَرَأُ</span>, <i>He repelled, pushed,</i> or <i>thrust.</i>
(K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَرَأَ مِنَ الطَّعَامِ</span> <i>He was,</i> or <i>became, filled
with food.</i> (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا وُرِئْتُ</span>, and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ما وُرِّئْتُ</span></b> ,
<i>I knew not.</i> (K.) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِالشَّىْءِ</span> ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ما أُورِئْتُ</span> <i>I knew
not the thing,</i> or <i>of the thing.</i> (L.)

